  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Treat order commands the same on the SBE and FIX servers\nLet a client tell an SBE server what became of an order\nTell a matcher venue what its accounts hold when it comes up\nLet the SBE adapter reach a server named by its host name\nServe History storage clients and file transfers over SBE\nBring in the debug branch: the cross-platform UI work and the move onto async persistence\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into broker-web-designer",
